\paragraph{}
\textbf{Prompt 2:} Provide a concise summary of the following text: 'A US woman was caught on CCTV licking a door handle in a New York hospital and was charged with a misdemeanor. The police said they were not sure if it was an anti-social act or a cry for help after a video went viral. Keesha Renee Johnson is believed to have licked the door of St Vincent's Hospital in Manhattan and then walked away.' Provide only the summary as the response.

\paragraph{}


