\section{Dataset}
\label{sec:dataset}
The dataset is constructed using the following method:

\begin{enumerate}
    \item Find all the URLs for the sports articles available in the GDELT dataset \footnote{See \url{http://gleditsch.kristin.name/gdextract.html}} for the years 2014-2015.
    \item Extract all the paragraphs from the articles in the GDELT dataset for each URL found.
